...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit 화면 { class: ours }

ui -> ui: "json.loads → (selected, feedback)"
ui -> user: "합격이면 \"Congratulations!...\" 성공 문구"
ui -> user: "합격이면 rerun 뒤 \"Click 'Proceed with Application'...\" 안내"
ui -> user: "탈락이면 \"Unfortunately...\" 경고"
ui -> user: "탈락이면 \"Feedback: ...\" (메일 보내기 전)"
ui -> user: "탈락이면 spinner \"Sending feedback email...\""
